<step1>
<ptxt>Seat Belt Control Computer</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage and resistance between each terminal or between each terminal and body ground.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E137690J01" width="7.106578999in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Using TaSCAN, check that pulses are generated between each terminal or between each terminal and body ground.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Inspect from the back side of the connector with the connector connected to the computer.</ptxt>
</atten3>
